Tessaveil third-party notices
============================

No third-party code or word lists are bundled at this foundation stage.

Development-only tools are not distributed as application components. Before
any third-party code, dictionary, or other asset is bundled, this file must
record its identity, source revision, license, copyright and attribution
obligations, redistribution decision, and any SignPath Foundation compatibility
decision. An Apache-2.0 license on original project code does not override
those terms.

Distribution gate: repository_redistribution=allowed AND
signpath_compatible=compatible. A forbidden/unclear redistribution result or an
incompatible/pending signing result blocks verified status and bundling.
Compatibility is a local assessment, not acceptance by SignPath Foundation.
See docs/research/licensing.md and docs/research/source-policy.md for evidence,
revision, SHA-256, verification-date and license-review requirements.

The Task 6 locked dependency review in spikes/mobile/dependency-review.md is
research-only and leaves distribution review pending. References, lockfile
entries and test dependencies are not declarations that those components are
shipped. Add actual upstream notices and license copies when an approved payload
is selected; this policy text supplies no third-party clearance or attribution.
